{"transcription": [{"offsets": {"from": 1000, "to": 10000}, "text": " All right, Carsten, we're going to unbox a Lunar Rover. A Lunar Rover unboxing. Let's do it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 10000, "to": 12000}, "text": " Here's the other side."}, {"offsets": {"from": 12000, "to": 13000}, "text": " Down here?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 13000, "to": 14000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 14000, "to": 15000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 15000, "to": 17000}, "text": " And the other side as well."}, {"offsets": {"from": 17000, "to": 21000}, "text": " Oh, I've got it. Yep. OK."}, {"offsets": {"from": 24000, "to": 25000}, "text": " Now, carefully."}, {"offsets": {"from": 25000, "to": 28000}, "text": " Oh, carefully, carefully. Here we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 28000, "to": 30000}, "text": " Oh, oh, right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 30000, "to": 32000}, "text": " Is it? No, wait."}, {"offsets": {"from": 32000, "to": 33000}, "text": " No."}, {"offsets": {"from": 33000, "to": 34000}, "text": " Wiggle it a little bit."}, {"offsets": {"from": 34000, "to": 35000}, "text": " Wiggle?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 35000, "to": 36000}, "text": " Go down a bit."}, {"offsets": {"from": 36000, "to": 37000}, "text": " Down a bit."}, {"offsets": {"from": 37000, "to": 38000}, "text": " Wiggle a bit."}, {"offsets": {"from": 40000, "to": 41000}, "text": " We're wiggling."}, {"offsets": {"from": 41000, "to": 43000}, "text": " We're wiggling a Lunar Rover."}, {"offsets": {"from": 43000, "to": 44000}, "text": " Ta-da!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 44000, "to": 45000}, "text": " Up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 45000, "to": 46000}, "text": " Oh."}, {"offsets": {"from": 46000, "to": 47000}, "text": " Come around."}, {"offsets": {"from": 47000, "to": 48000}, "text": " Up and come around."}, {"offsets": {"from": 48000, "to": 49000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 49000, "to": 50000}, "text": " All right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 50000, "to": 51000}, "text": " There we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 51000, "to": 52000}, "text": " Ta-da!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 52000, "to": 53000}, "text": " Wow!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 53000, "to": 54000}, "text": " Wow!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 54000, "to": 55000}, "text": " That is bigger."}, {"offsets": {"from": 55000, "to": 57000}, "text": " That is much bigger than I thought it would be."}, {"offsets": {"from": 57000, "to": 60000}, "text": " I thought it would be about that big."}, {"offsets": {"from": 60000, "to": 61000}, "text": " You know what's funny?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 61000, "to": 63000}, "text": " That, you know, no one has ever said to me,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 63000, "to": 65000}, "text": " oh, this is about the size I expected it to be."}, {"offsets": {"from": 65000, "to": 67000}, "text": " You know, there are people coming like,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 67000, "to": 69000}, "text": " oh, this is bigger than I thought."}, {"offsets": {"from": 69000, "to": 71000}, "text": " And there are people coming, oh, this is smaller than I thought."}, {"offsets": {"from": 71000, "to": 72000}, "text": " Smaller? Really?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 72000, "to": 73000}, "text": " Yeah, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 73000, "to": 74000}, "text": " OK."}, {"offsets": {"from": 74000, "to": 75000}, "text": " I have a squiz."}, {"offsets": {"from": 75000, "to": 76000}, "text": " This is my first look at it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 76000, "to": 77000}, "text": " Oh, wow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 77000, "to": 78000}, "text": " Beautiful."}, {"offsets": {"from": 78000, "to": 79000}, "text": " Beautiful."}, {"offsets": {"from": 79000, "to": 82000}, "text": " It is the Audi Lunar Quattro,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 82000, "to": 84000}, "text": " because you're sponsored by Audi."}, {"offsets": {"from": 84000, "to": 85000}, "text": " Exactly."}, {"offsets": {"from": 85000, "to": 86000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 86000, "to": 87000}, "text": " And it's a Google Lunar XPRIZE."}, {"offsets": {"from": 87000, "to": 90000}, "text": " Oh, hot, hot melt glue."}, {"offsets": {"from": 90000, "to": 92000}, "text": " Hot melt glue."}, {"offsets": {"from": 92000, "to": 93000}, "text": " Yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 93000, "to": 94000}, "text": " Yeah, don't take a look at this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 94000, "to": 97000}, "text": " This is something that I just very quickly added"}, {"offsets": {"from": 97000, "to": 98000}, "text": " for the purpose of coming here,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 98000, "to": 101000}, "text": " because we're doing some testing in the dark area"}, {"offsets": {"from": 101000, "to": 102000}, "text": " and I want to illuminate it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 102000, "to": 103000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 103000, "to": 104000}, "text": " Got it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 104000, "to": 105000}, "text": " This is not something that you will find"}, {"offsets": {"from": 105000, "to": 106000}, "text": " on the real Rover probably."}, {"offsets": {"from": 106000, "to": 107000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 107000, "to": 110000}, "text": " And are these the real wheels?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 110000, "to": 111000}, "text": " Yes, those are..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 111000, "to": 113000}, "text": " Cast alloy are they?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 113000, "to": 116000}, "text": " No, no, this is 3D printed aluminum."}, {"offsets": {"from": 116000, "to": 117000}, "text": " It's a..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 117000, "to": 118000}, "text": " 3D printed aluminum."}, {"offsets": {"from": 118000, "to": 119000}, "text": " Exactly."}, {"offsets": {"from": 119000, "to": 121000}, "text": " So this is really a one millimeter aluminum hull."}, {"offsets": {"from": 121000, "to": 122000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 122000, "to": 123000}, "text": " All around."}, {"offsets": {"from": 123000, "to": 125000}, "text": " And it's extremely lightweight."}, {"offsets": {"from": 125000, "to": 126000}, "text": " Nice."}, {"offsets": {"from": 126000, "to": 127000}, "text": " Yeah, pretty sturdy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 127000, "to": 128000}, "text": " Wow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 128000, "to": 131000}, "text": " The profile is not exactly the one we are going to use on the moon."}, {"offsets": {"from": 131000, "to": 132000}, "text": " OK, right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 132000, "to": 133000}, "text": " This is more for the looks of it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 133000, "to": 134000}, "text": " Got it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 134000, "to": 135000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 136000, "to": 138000}, "text": " The manufacturing is about the same."}, {"offsets": {"from": 138000, "to": 139000}, "text": " But on the moon,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 139000, "to": 142000}, "text": " you'd actually used some sort of 3D printed alloy?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 142000, "to": 143000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 143000, "to": 144000}, "text": " OK."}, {"offsets": {"from": 144000, "to": 146000}, "text": " 3D printed aluminum is working pretty fine for the moon."}, {"offsets": {"from": 146000, "to": 147000}, "text": " Excellent."}, {"offsets": {"from": 147000, "to": 150000}, "text": " What's really neat about this is this part here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 150000, "to": 152000}, "text": " This is one part."}, {"offsets": {"from": 152000, "to": 155000}, "text": " And the beam actually that you see is hollow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 155000, "to": 156000}, "text": " Yeah, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 156000, "to": 159000}, "text": " And so we are routing the cables for the electronics on each side."}, {"offsets": {"from": 159000, "to": 160000}, "text": " Ah, right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 160000, "to": 161000}, "text": " Yes, of course."}, {"offsets": {"from": 161000, "to": 164000}, "text": " So this makes it look very sleek."}, {"offsets": {"from": 164000, "to": 166000}, "text": " And it also reduces the weight significantly."}, {"offsets": {"from": 166000, "to": 168000}, "text": " So you've got a hub motor in there?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 168000, "to": 169000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 169000, "to": 170000}, "text": " Some sort of, yeah?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 170000, "to": 171000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 171000, "to": 172000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 172000, "to": 173000}, "text": " Is that just a regular,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 173000, "to": 175000}, "text": " like do you need some space grade hub motor"}, {"offsets": {"from": 175000, "to": 179000}, "text": " that keeps out the lunar dust and all the rest of it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 179000, "to": 182000}, "text": " Yeah, so for the dust you need to be very careful"}, {"offsets": {"from": 182000, "to": 184000}, "text": " because it's very fine powder."}, {"offsets": {"from": 184000, "to": 185000}, "text": " It can get into everything."}, {"offsets": {"from": 185000, "to": 186000}, "text": " Ah, yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 186000, "to": 188000}, "text": " So you need to have a good,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 188000, "to": 191000}, "text": " I don't know the English term for it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 191000, "to": 192000}, "text": " So you need to make sure that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 192000, "to": 193000}, "text": " Seal."}, {"offsets": {"from": 193000, "to": 194000}, "text": " Seal, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 194000, "to": 197000}, "text": " You need to have a very good seal so it doesn't get any in there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 197000, "to": 200000}, "text": " But from a motor you want to use a brushless motor"}, {"offsets": {"from": 200000, "to": 201000}, "text": " instead of a brushed motor."}, {"offsets": {"from": 201000, "to": 202000}, "text": " Got it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 202000, "to": 204000}, "text": " Because you're in vacuum and with a brush"}, {"offsets": {"from": 204000, "to": 207000}, "text": " it could be that there is some cold melting happening."}, {"offsets": {"from": 207000, "to": 208000}, "text": " Oh, okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 208000, "to": 209000}, "text": " Sorry."}, {"offsets": {"from": 209000, "to": 210000}, "text": " Interesting."}, {"offsets": {"from": 210000, "to": 211000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 211000, "to": 212000}, "text": " So brushless is the go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 212000, "to": 213000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 213000, "to": 214000}, "text": " For lunar rovers."}, {"offsets": {"from": 214000, "to": 215000}, "text": " There you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 215000, "to": 216000}, "text": " Exactly."}, {"offsets": {"from": 216000, "to": 217000}, "text": " Wow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 217000, "to": 218000}, "text": " E-tron."}, {"offsets": {"from": 218000, "to": 219000}, "text": " Yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 219000, "to": 220000}, "text": " Who is E-tron?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 220000, "to": 221000}, "text": " Who or what is E-tron?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 221000, "to": 223000}, "text": " The Audi brand for the electric cars."}, {"offsets": {"from": 223000, "to": 224000}, "text": " Oh, okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 224000, "to": 225000}, "text": " Yes, of course."}, {"offsets": {"from": 225000, "to": 226000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 226000, "to": 229000}, "text": " Oh, and you've got to have some 4mm banana plugs."}, {"offsets": {"from": 229000, "to": 230000}, "text": " Look at that, Jax."}, {"offsets": {"from": 230000, "to": 234000}, "text": " Yeah, this is the high-tech solution for switching it on and off."}, {"offsets": {"from": 234000, "to": 235000}, "text": " Fantastic."}, {"offsets": {"from": 235000, "to": 237000}, "text": " So you've got like a little plug."}, {"offsets": {"from": 237000, "to": 240000}, "text": " Unfortunately it has the Belgian flag on it instead of the German."}, {"offsets": {"from": 240000, "to": 241000}, "text": " No."}, {"offsets": {"from": 241000, "to": 243000}, "text": " And it's Bluetooth, is it not?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 243000, "to": 245000}, "text": " So that's a little Bluetooth antenna?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 245000, "to": 246000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 246000, "to": 248000}, "text": " The problem is that everything is made of aluminum"}, {"offsets": {"from": 248000, "to": 252000}, "text": " so you need to put the antenna outside to get any reception."}, {"offsets": {"from": 252000, "to": 253000}, "text": " Got it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 253000, "to": 254000}, "text": " Of course."}, {"offsets": {"from": 254000, "to": 256000}, "text": " But that won't be on the final production one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 256000, "to": 257000}, "text": " No."}, {"offsets": {"from": 257000, "to": 260000}, "text": " Is the solar panel production ready?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 260000, "to": 261000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 261000, "to": 263000}, "text": " This is a production ready one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 263000, "to": 264000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 264000, "to": 266000}, "text": " This is a Alter Devices cells."}, {"offsets": {"from": 266000, "to": 268000}, "text": " Those are extremely thin."}, {"offsets": {"from": 268000, "to": 269000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 269000, "to": 270000}, "text": " You can bend them actually."}, {"offsets": {"from": 270000, "to": 271000}, "text": " Oh, okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 271000, "to": 272000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 272000, "to": 273000}, "text": " And this has a slight curved surface."}, {"offsets": {"from": 273000, "to": 275000}, "text": " It does have a slight curved surface."}, {"offsets": {"from": 275000, "to": 276000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 276000, "to": 277000}, "text": " Which is mostly for the looks."}, {"offsets": {"from": 277000, "to": 280000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 280000, "to": 281000}, "text": " Fantastic."}, {"offsets": {"from": 281000, "to": 283000}, "text": " Let's have a look at the back."}, {"offsets": {"from": 283000, "to": 286000}, "text": " It's a very sexy looking unit."}, {"offsets": {"from": 286000, "to": 287000}, "text": " It really is."}, {"offsets": {"from": 287000, "to": 288000}, "text": " Wow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 288000, "to": 292000}, "text": " You can see that we got some help from our friends at Audi."}, {"offsets": {"from": 292000, "to": 293000}, "text": " Audi, right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 293000, "to": 295000}, "text": " Okay, so it didn't look this good before Audi came along?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 295000, "to": 296000}, "text": " No."}, {"offsets": {"from": 296000, "to": 298000}, "text": " No, before we called it a tank."}, {"offsets": {"from": 298000, "to": 299000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 299000, "to": 303000}, "text": " So before it was highly functional, not very well looking,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 303000, "to": 307000}, "text": " but now it's sexy and it's really lightweight."}, {"offsets": {"from": 307000, "to": 308000}, "text": " Got it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 308000, "to": 310000}, "text": " You know, in a second when you lift it up, you will be like, whoa."}, {"offsets": {"from": 310000, "to": 311000}, "text": " Oh, okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 311000, "to": 312000}, "text": " We can lift it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 312000, "to": 313000}, "text": " Sure."}, {"offsets": {"from": 313000, "to": 314000}, "text": " All right, let's go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 314000, "to": 315000}, "text": " Now we've got to put it on the table, right?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 315000, "to": 316000}, "text": " Yep, we'll put it on the table."}, {"offsets": {"from": 316000, "to": 318000}, "text": " Hang on, this could be a..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 318000, "to": 319000}, "text": " Here we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 319000, "to": 320000}, "text": " All right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 320000, "to": 322000}, "text": " So if you lift it, you take it here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 322000, "to": 324000}, "text": " Oh, on the top frame."}, {"offsets": {"from": 324000, "to": 325000}, "text": " Okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 325000, "to": 326000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 326000, "to": 331000}, "text": " All right, let's lift her up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 332000, "to": 334000}, "text": " Here we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 334000, "to": 335000}, "text": " Oh, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 335000, "to": 339000}, "text": " That weighs 20 kilos?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 339000, "to": 340000}, "text": " 25."}, {"offsets": {"from": 340000, "to": 341000}, "text": " Yeah, okay, 25."}, {"offsets": {"from": 341000, "to": 342000}, "text": " There you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 342000, "to": 346000}, "text": " It's kind of bigger than I thought."}, {"offsets": {"from": 346000, "to": 348000}, "text": " I thought we'd be able to..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 348000, "to": 351000}, "text": " Like, I seriously thought it'd be half that size."}, {"offsets": {"from": 351000, "to": 355000}, "text": " I thought it would be half that, because I was picturing us being able to, like,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 355000, "to": 358000}, "text": " shoot a video with this in front of it, talking about it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 358000, "to": 364000}, "text": " But obviously, that's going to change the logistics of how we shoot the video."}, {"offsets": {"from": 364000, "to": 365000}, "text": " So..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 365000, "to": 366000}, "text": " There'll probably be more."}, {"offsets": {"from": 366000, "to": 368000}, "text": " But that is..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 368000, "to": 371000}, "text": " That is awesome."}, {"offsets": {"from": 371000, "to": 373000}, "text": " I've got a Lunar Rover in my lab."}, {"offsets": {"from": 373000, "to": 377000}, "text": " Thank you very much, Carsten, for coming all the way from Germany."}, {"offsets": {"from": 377000, "to": 378000}, "text": " Yeah, you're welcome."}, {"offsets": {"from": 378000, "to": 381000}, "text": " I'd love to say just to see me, but no."}, {"offsets": {"from": 381000, "to": 384000}, "text": " Unfortunately, you know, he just happened to be in Sydney,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 384000, "to": 386000}, "text": " and hey, I've got a Lunar Rover, and..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 386000, "to": 388000}, "text": " Wow. Awesome."}, {"offsets": {"from": 388000, "to": 389000}, "text": " There you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 389000, "to": 394000}, "text": " That's the world's first unboxing of a Lunar Rover."}, {"offsets": {"from": 394000, "to": 395000}, "text": " Unbelievable."}, {"offsets": {"from": 395000, "to": 397000}, "text": " Thanks, Carsten."}, {"offsets": {"from": 397000, "to": 401000}, "text": " And we're going to drive it around a car park, just because we can."}, {"offsets": {"from": 401000, "to": 403000}, "text": " And it's a Sunday."}, {"offsets": {"from": 403000, "to": 405000}, "text": " Oh, look, look."}, {"offsets": {"from": 405000, "to": 407000}, "text": " Oh, it lights up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 407000, "to": 409000}, "text": " Oh, beautiful."}, {"offsets": {"from": 409000, "to": 411000}, "text": " All right, Carsten."}, {"offsets": {"from": 411000, "to": 415000}, "text": " Let it rip."}, {"offsets": {"from": 416000, "to": 418000}, "text": " Ah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 418000, "to": 422000}, "text": " Adjustment required."}, {"offsets": {"from": 422000, "to": 424000}, "text": " Go, little Quattro."}, {"offsets": {"from": 424000, "to": 430000}, "text": " You can do it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 430000, "to": 439000}, "text": " With a top speed of about one metre per second."}, {"offsets": {"from": 439000, "to": 442000}, "text": " So that's about top speed as far as you can get."}, {"offsets": {"from": 442000, "to": 448000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 448000, "to": 450000}, "text": " Okay, show us the app, Carsten."}, {"offsets": {"from": 450000, "to": 455000}, "text": " Yeah, so this is the very sophisticated remote control app that we developed."}, {"offsets": {"from": 455000, "to": 459000}, "text": " It's actually designed in such a way that even children could use it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 459000, "to": 462000}, "text": " So if you're going here, it goes straight."}, {"offsets": {"from": 462000, "to": 465000}, "text": " You can go, the further you go from the middle, the faster it goes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 465000, "to": 466000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 466000, "to": 470000}, "text": " And if you go a little to the left, you know, it actually turns left."}, {"offsets": {"from": 471000, "to": 472000}, "text": " Got it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 472000, "to": 475000}, "text": " And go a little to the right, and it turns right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 475000, "to": 478000}, "text": " And go a little to the left, like this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 478000, "to": 480000}, "text": " And you can go a little to the right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 480000, "to": 482000}, "text": " And go to the right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 482000, "to": 484000}, "text": " And it does the same backwards."}, {"offsets": {"from": 484000, "to": 486000}, "text": " You can see it can turn on the spot."}, {"offsets": {"from": 486000, "to": 488000}, "text": " Isn't that cool?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 488000, "to": 496000}, "text": " And then if you pull your finger down, you'll go backwards, yeah?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 496000, "to": 499000}, "text": " And if you move your finger in a circle, you'll go in a circle."}, {"offsets": {"from": 499000, "to": 500000}, "text": " No, don't do that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 500000, "to": 501000}, "text": " No?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 501000, "to": 505000}, "text": " No, this is, for example, if you want to steer on the spot."}, {"offsets": {"from": 505000, "to": 507000}, "text": " Oh, okay, right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 507000, "to": 511000}, "text": " But the problem is that it's not easy to go from turning to,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 511000, "to": 513000}, "text": " so it's not a good idea to cross this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 513000, "to": 514000}, "text": " Oh, it's not a good idea to go around?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 514000, "to": 515000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 515000, "to": 516000}, "text": " Okay, got it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 516000, "to": 517000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 517000, "to": 521000}, "text": " So, but you can, you know, drive around like this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 521000, "to": 524000}, "text": " Somehow I don't think it's getting up there any time soon."}, {"offsets": {"from": 524000, "to": 529000}, "text": " No."}, {"offsets": {"from": 529000, "to": 531000}, "text": " You've got to have a go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 531000, "to": 532000}, "text": " Here we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 532000, "to": 534000}, "text": " If Sagan can do it, I can do it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 534000, "to": 542000}, "text": " All right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 542000, "to": 545000}, "text": " And that's his blistering top speed."}, {"offsets": {"from": 545000, "to": 549000}, "text": " That's actually half the speed because I limited you a little bit."}, {"offsets": {"from": 549000, "to": 550000}, "text": " He limited me."}, {"offsets": {"from": 550000, "to": 552000}, "text": " He didn't trust me."}, {"offsets": {"from": 552000, "to": 559000}, "text": " He didn't trust me."}, {"offsets": {"from": 559000, "to": 564000}, "text": " Here we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 564000, "to": 567000}, "text": " And it takes another one and a half seconds until you see what you have done."}, {"offsets": {"from": 567000, "to": 572000}, "text": " And so you can do a three-second delay to simulate what it is driving on the moon."}, {"offsets": {"from": 572000, "to": 578000}, "text": " And so if you press now, one, two, three, and why doesn't it move?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 578000, "to": 579000}, "text": " Oh, okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 579000, "to": 581000}, "text": " A little bit longer than three seconds."}, {"offsets": {"from": 581000, "to": 585000}, "text": " One, two, three."}, {"offsets": {"from": 585000, "to": 586000}, "text": " You see?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 586000, "to": 590000}, "text": " It's a delay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 590000, "to": 593000}, "text": " Whoa, it can get down that?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 593000, "to": 597000}, "text": " Whoa, that hurt."}, {"offsets": {"from": 597000, "to": 598000}, "text": " Hi."}, {"offsets": {"from": 598000, "to": 600000}, "text": " Check what I've got in the lab."}, {"offsets": {"from": 600000, "to": 602000}, "text": " It's a lunar rover."}, {"offsets": {"from": 602000, "to": 603000}, "text": " Do you believe it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 603000, "to": 605000}, "text": " It's the Audi Lunar Quattro."}, {"offsets": {"from": 605000, "to": 609000}, "text": " And with me is the head electronics designer, Carsten."}, {"offsets": {"from": 609000, "to": 611000}, "text": " Thank you very much for joining us."}, {"offsets": {"from": 611000, "to": 612000}, "text": " Hey, welcome."}, {"offsets": {"from": 612000, "to": 613000}, "text": " Excellent."}, {"offsets": {"from": 613000, "to": 618000}, "text": " You're going to tell us all about the Audi Lunar Quattro and the X-Prize."}, {"offsets": {"from": 618000, "to": 619000}, "text": " Exactly."}, {"offsets": {"from": 619000, "to": 623000}, "text": " So this is actually the first generation rover prototype that we developed."}, {"offsets": {"from": 623000, "to": 627000}, "text": " So before this one, we actually had four other ones."}], "source": "whisper-1-api"}